WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.357 --> 00:00:10.592
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WELCOME BACK TO

00:00:09.124 --> 00:00:11.493
TONIGHT SPECIAL, INSIDE THE

00:00:10.726 --> 00:00:12.294
ISSUES.

00:00:11.627 --> 00:00:14.730
THE AMERICAN CIVIL RIGHTS

00:00:12.428 --> 00:00:16.799
ORGANIZATIONS USE TO CARE ABOUT,

00:00:14.863 --> 00:00:20.002
WELL, CIVIL RIGHTS, NO SURPRISE.

00:00:16.932 --> 00:00:23.105
BUT RECENTLY THE NAACP HAS SAID

00:00:20.135 --> 00:00:28.110
IT REGARDS CLIMATE CHANGE'S

00:00:23.238 --> 00:00:29.244
CIVIL RIGHTS ISSUE AND THAT

00:00:28.243 --> 00:00:31.113
EQUALITY CANNOT BE ACHIEVED

00:00:29.378 --> 00:00:32.314
WITHOUT ENVIRONMENTAL JUSTICE,

00:00:31.246 --> 00:00:37.519
WHATEVER THAT IS.

00:00:32.448 --> 00:00:39.321
WE SPOKE WE SPOKE TO PORTIA

00:00:37.653 --> 00:00:41.323
SHEPPARD ABOUT THIS.

00:00:39.455 --> 00:00:43.392
SO, IT'S A LITTLE BIT CONFUSING

00:00:41.457 --> 00:00:45.294
FOR A COUPLE OF REASONS, THE

00:00:43.525 --> 00:00:47.896
MOST OBVIOUS IS, I AGREE WITH

00:00:45.427 --> 00:00:48.530
BOTH GOALS, A CLEANING,

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:49.898
ENVIRONMENTAL AND RACIAL

00:00:48.664 --> 00:00:52.434
EQUALITY, BUT IT'S HARD TO SEE

00:00:50.032 --> 00:00:52.801
EXACTLY WHY THEY ARE TIED

00:00:52.568 --> 00:00:53.736
TOGETHER.

00:00:52.935 --> 00:00:58.073
HOW ARE THEY?

00:00:53.869 --> 00:00:59.775
&gt;&gt; WELL I CAN'T SPEAK FOR THE

00:00:58.207 --> 00:01:00.909
NAACP BUT WHAT I CAN SPEAK FOR

00:00:59.908 --> 00:01:03.312
IS THE ENVIRONMENTAL INJUSTICE

00:01:01.043 --> 00:01:04.947
THAT WE HAVE HERE IN THE BLACK

00:01:03.445 --> 00:01:06.548
BELT OF ALABAMA.

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:08.951
PART OF IT IS AS IT RELATES TO

00:01:06.682 --> 00:01:11.120
WHAT DR. KING STOOD FOR, HE

00:01:09.084 --> 00:01:12.955
STOOD FOR JUSTICE, AND STAND UP

00:01:11.253 --> 00:01:14.123
FOR INJUSTICE THAT IS HAPPENING

00:01:13.088 --> 00:01:16.125
IN ALL KINDS OF COMMUNITIES.

00:01:14.256 --> 00:01:17.426
WHEN YOU LOOK HERE IN THE GREAT

00:01:16.258 --> 00:01:19.695
STATE OF ALABAMA, IT'S NOT JUST

00:01:17.559 --> 00:01:23.999
IN THE BLACK BELT OF ALABAMA, IT

00:01:19.828 --> 00:01:23.399
JUST SO HAPPENS THAT IN LAWRENCE

00:01:23.399 --> 00:01:24.700
JUST SO HAPPENS THAT IN LAWRENC

00:01:24.133 --> 00:01:25.901
LAWRENCE COUNTY THEY ARE

00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:28.170
EXPERIENCING THE SAME FIGHT AS

00:01:26.034 --> 00:01:28.570
IT RELATES TO THE ENVIRONMENT OF

00:01:28.303 --> 00:01:30.906
INJUSTICES.

00:01:28.704 --> 00:01:33.108
IT HAPPENS IN OUR COMMUNITY, THE

00:01:31.039 --> 00:01:34.510
MAJORITY OF PEOPLE FACING THESE

00:01:33.242 --> 00:01:37.112
PROBLEMS ARE PEOPLE OF COLOR.

00:01:34.643 --> 00:01:37.913
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OKAY BUT BY THAT

00:01:37.246 --> 00:01:39.114
STANDARD, COULD YOU SAY

00:01:38.046 --> 00:01:40.115
MARTIN LUTHER KING FOUGHT FOR

00:01:39.248 --> 00:01:41.917
JUSTICE, AND HE DID?

00:01:40.249 --> 00:01:43.051
AND IS UNJUST FOR THE GOVERNMENT

00:01:42.050 --> 00:01:45.154
TO TAKE MOST OF WHAT YOU HAVE

00:01:43.185 --> 00:01:46.622
EARNED -- I THINK YOU AGREE THEY

00:01:45.287 --> 00:01:47.956
SHOULDN'T TAKE MOST OF IT.

00:01:46.755 --> 00:01:49.958
SO MARTIN LUTHER KING WOULD BE

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:50.959
IN FAVOR OF LOWER TAX RATES.

00:01:50.092 --> 00:01:52.895
BUT HE DIDN'T TALK ABOUT LOWER

00:01:51.093 --> 00:01:54.730
TAX RATES OR OF GLOBAL WARNING

00:01:53.028 --> 00:01:59.368
SO MAYBE WE SHOULDN'T GET HIM

00:01:54.863 --> 00:02:04.506
INVOLVED IN THOSE ISSUES?

00:01:59.501 --> 00:02:06.108
&gt;&gt; AS IT RELATES TO INJUSTICE,

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:07.910
THE LEGACY OF WHAT

00:02:06.241 --> 00:02:09.411
DR. KING STOOD FOR, THAT'S THE

00:02:08.043 --> 00:02:11.914
SAME MESSAGE THAT WE ARE SENDING

00:02:09.545 --> 00:02:12.915
IN THE TOOLS WE ARE USING IN

00:02:12.047 --> 00:02:13.248
THIS FIGHT FOR ENVIRONMENTAL

00:02:13.048 --> 00:02:14.917
JUSTICE.

00:02:13.382 --> 00:02:16.185
WHEN YOU TIME AND TIME AGAIN

00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:19.087
HAVE A COMMUNITY IS ESPECIALLY

00:02:16.318 --> 00:02:26.395
IN BLACK BELT OF ALABAMA THAT

00:02:19.221 --> 00:02:27.863
DON'T HAVE EQUITABLE SEWAGE, YOU

00:02:26.528 --> 00:02:29.932
HAVE PEOPLE BEING POISONED.

00:02:27.996 --> 00:02:30.933
YOU WOULD THINK THIS WOULD BE A

00:02:30.065 --> 00:02:32.534
CIVIL RIGHTS ISSUE BECAUSE A LOT

00:02:31.066 --> 00:02:33.035
OF THE PEOPLE BEING AFFECTED ARE

00:02:32.668 --> 00:02:36.405
PEOPLE OF COLOR.

00:02:33.168 --> 00:02:37.306
SO IN THAT ASPECT OF IT, I CAN

00:02:36.538 --> 00:02:38.740
DEFINITELY UNDERSTAND THAT.

00:02:37.439 --> 00:02:40.609
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I CAN SORT OF SEE

00:02:38.874 --> 00:02:42.244
WHAT YOU'RE SAYING, NO DOUBT

00:02:41.043 --> 00:02:43.612
THAT POOR PEOPLE LIVE IN CRUMMY

00:02:42.377 --> 00:02:44.413
OR PLACES AND THAT ARE MORE

00:02:43.745 --> 00:02:45.714
POLLUTED.

00:02:44.546 --> 00:02:48.283
BUT THERE ARE OBVIOUS REASONS

00:02:45.848 --> 00:02:49.318
FOR THAT, SOME OF THEM SINISTER,

00:02:48.417 --> 00:02:51.253
I AGREE.

00:02:49.451 --> 00:02:53.689
BUT THE MOST POLLUTED PLACES ON

00:02:51.386 --> 00:02:58.894
EARTH, THE UKRAINE WHERE THE

00:02:53.822 --> 00:03:01.797
CHERNOBYL ACCIDENT HAPPENED,

00:02:59.027 --> 00:03:03.232
IT'S NOT A RACIAL ISSUE BUT IT'S

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:04.299
A CONSPIRACY TO POLLUTE BECAUSE

00:03:03.365 --> 00:03:06.969
OF SKIN COLOR.

00:03:04.433 --> 00:03:08.837
IF WE DON'T HAVE EVIDENCE THAT'S

00:03:07.102 --> 00:03:09.905
TRUE, WE PROBABLY SHOULDN'T

00:03:09.071 --> 00:03:12.007
SUGGEST IT, RIGHT?

00:03:10.038 --> 00:03:14.710
&gt;&gt; I AGREE TO A CERTAIN EXTENT,

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:15.544
BUT AS FAR AS A CLASS POINT, I

00:03:14.843 --> 00:03:18.113
ABSOLUTELY AGREE.

00:03:15.677 --> 00:03:19.214
THAT'S ONE REASON I BROUGHT UP

00:03:18.413 --> 00:03:21.550
LAWRENCE AND MACON COUNTY.

00:03:19.348 --> 00:03:22.351
THAT'S UP TO HIM PREDOMINATELY

00:03:21.683 --> 00:03:24.853
WHITE COUNTY BUT THE MEDIAN

00:03:22.484 --> 00:03:25.954
INCOME IS BETWEEN TEN AND

00:03:24.987 --> 00:03:27.155
$17,000 PER YEAR.

00:03:26.088 --> 00:03:28.557
YOU HAVE TO SAY THIS IS

00:03:27.289 --> 00:03:30.792
DEFINITELY A POINT OF CLASS.

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:34.062
IT'S NOT SO MUCH THAT WE WANT TO

00:03:30.926 --> 00:03:35.297
LIVE IN A POOR AREA BUT ME

00:03:34.196 --> 00:03:36.732
PERSONALLY, I CAN TESTIFY FOR

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:38.100
MYSELF, I INHERITED LAND IN THAT

00:03:36.865 --> 00:03:40.168
PARTICULAR AREA AND I'M NOT

00:03:38.233 --> 00:03:41.937
GOING TO GIVE IT UP BECAUSE IT'S

00:03:40.302 --> 00:03:43.338
A POOR AREA.

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:44.273
IT'S UNFAIR ESPECIALLY FOR THAT

00:03:43.472 --> 00:03:45.541
PARTICULAR COMMUNITY, WHERE YOU

00:03:44.439 --> 00:03:46.508
HAVE THE MAJORITY OF THE PEOPLE

00:03:45.674 --> 00:03:48.744
WHO LIVE THERE THAT I OWNED THAT

00:03:46.642 --> 00:03:49.711
LAND HAVE TO GIVE IT UP BECAUSE

00:03:48.877 --> 00:03:53.315
YOU HAVE POLITICIANS AND PEOPLE

00:03:49.845 --> 00:03:54.550
WHO ARE IN POWER WHO MAKE

00:03:53.448 --> 00:03:56.151
DECISIONS WHO DUMP THESE

00:03:54.683 --> 00:03:57.419
PARTICULAR ISSUES ON THEM.

00:03:56.285 --> 00:04:00.289
THAT'S ONE OF THE PARTS THAT

00:03:57.553 --> 00:04:02.524
BLACK BELT CITIZENS IS FIGHTING.

00:04:00.422 --> 00:04:04.092
IT'S NOT SO MUCH, OH, IT CIVIL

00:04:02.658 --> 00:04:06.128
RIGHTS, ITS BLACK POWER.

00:04:04.226 --> 00:04:06.828
IT'S NOT ABOUT THAT, IT'S ABOUT

00:04:06.261 --> 00:04:09.731
HELPING PEOPLE STAND UP FOR

00:04:06.962 --> 00:04:11.700
THEMSELVES AND GET THE JUSTICE

00:04:09.865 --> 00:04:13.502
THAT THEY DESERVE.

00:04:11.833 --> 00:04:15.003
THEY DESERVE CLEAN WATER.

00:04:13.635 --> 00:04:16.204
MY MOM HAD NO BUSINESS BUYING

00:04:15.137 --> 00:04:17.606
THREE OR FOUR CASES OF WATER PER

00:04:16.338 --> 00:04:18.840
WEEK SO SHE COULD COOK A MEAL

00:04:17.739 --> 00:04:20.576
BECAUSE SHE WAS AFRAID TO DRINK

00:04:19.207 --> 00:04:20.909
THE WATER COMING OUT OF THE

00:04:20.709 --> 00:04:22.177
FAUCET.

00:04:21.043 --> 00:04:22.911
THOSE THINGS SHOULD NOT BE

00:04:22.311 --> 00:04:24.279
HAPPENING.

00:04:23.045 --> 00:04:25.948
AND IT JUST SO HAPPENS THAT WHEN

00:04:24.413 --> 00:04:31.320
YOU TALK ABOUT CIVIL RIGHTS

00:04:26.081 --> 00:04:32.921
ISSUES, YOU SEE IT IN UNIONTOWN

00:04:31.453 --> 00:04:33.555
ALABAMA, THESE ISSUES ARE

00:04:33.055 --> 00:04:35.724
DEFINITELY TAKING PLACE.

00:04:33.689 --> 00:04:37.960
IT JUST SO HAPPENED IN THAT

00:04:35.857 --> 00:04:39.795
AREA, ITS PEOPLE OF COLOR BUT

00:04:38.093 --> 00:04:42.030
IT'S DEFINITELY A CLASS ISSUE.

00:04:39.928 --> 00:04:43.532
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I HAVE TO SAY, I

00:04:42.164 --> 00:04:43.865
AGREE WITH A LOT OF WHAT YOU'RE

00:04:43.665 --> 00:04:45.367
SAYING.

00:04:43.999 --> 00:04:47.336
AND I HOPE THAT YOU DON'T SELL

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:50.005
YOUR LAND BECAUSE SOME OF THE

00:04:47.469 --> 00:04:52.708
PRETTIEST PLACES IN THIS COUNTRY

00:04:50.138 --> 00:04:58.313
ARE RURAL AREAS.

00:04:52.841 --> 00:04:58.914
&gt;&gt; AND THEY ARE A LOT SAFER.

00:04:58.447 --> 00:05:00.315
[LAUGHS]

00:04:59.414 --> 00:05:00.916
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SAFER AND NICE

00:05:00.449 --> 00:05:02.084
PEOPLE.

00:05:01.049 --> 00:05:04.319
BUT MAYBE THE PEOPLE IN CHARGE

00:05:02.217 --> 00:05:07.656
IGNORE AND EXPLOIT RURAL

00:05:04.453 --> 00:05:08.123
AMERICA, DID YOU EVER THINK OF

00:05:07.789 --> 00:05:08.724
THAT?

00:05:08.256 --> 00:05:10.125
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.

00:05:08.857 --> 00:05:11.760
THAT GOES BACK TO THE CLASS

00:05:10.258 --> 00:05:13.395
STATEMENT THAT YOU MADE EARLIER,

00:05:11.893 --> 00:05:16.131
IT GOES RIGHT BACK TO THAT.

00:05:13.528 --> 00:05:17.733
EVEN THOUGH I AM AND DURING THE

00:05:16.264 --> 00:05:18.934
SAME STUFF THAT YOU ARE ENDURING

00:05:17.866 --> 00:05:20.535
BUT I HAVE A LITTLE BIT MORE

00:05:19.067 --> 00:05:22.537
THAN YOU, I CAN FEEL LIKE I'M

00:05:20.669 --> 00:05:23.739
ABOVE IT AND THAT'S THE BIGGEST

00:05:22.671 --> 00:05:26.541
ISSUE OF THEM ALL.

00:05:23.872 --> 00:05:28.343
THAT'S WHAT DR. KING WAS ABOUT.

00:05:26.675 --> 00:05:29.611
THAT CAMPAIGN HE WAS GETTING

00:05:28.477 --> 00:05:31.613
READY TO KICK OFF BEFORE HIS

00:05:29.745 --> 00:05:34.316
ASSASSINATION, IT WAS FOR POOR

00:05:31.747 --> 00:05:35.617
PEOPLE.

00:05:34.449 --> 00:05:38.353
AND YOU SEE THAT TIME AND TIME

00:05:35.751 --> 00:05:40.522
AGAIN, IT IS SPECIFICALLY IN

00:05:38.487 --> 00:05:42.724
POOR COMMUNITIES, AND MORE THAN

00:05:40.656 --> 00:05:43.225
LIKELY, PEOPLE OF COLOR WILL BE

00:05:42.858 --> 00:05:45.927
AFFECTED BY THAT.

00:05:43.358 --> 00:05:49.131
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I KIND OF AGREE

00:05:46.061 --> 00:05:51.533
WITH WHAT YOU ARE SAYING.

